# Blood on the screen, 320x180 overlays, transparent in the middle: hit
# (two corners), heavy (every edge), drip (game over: running down from the
# top). Fade them out; with "reduce flashing" on, do not pulse them.
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
